      "title": "Vaccination of Health Care Workers Recommended",
      "pageStart": 1,
      "pageEnd": 1,
      "target": "../sections/sec-001-vaccination-of-health-care-workers-recommended.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "BCG 1\nBCG vaccination is recommended for unvaccinated TST- or IGRA-negative persons at risk of occupational exposure in low and high TB incidence areas (e.g. health-\ncare workers, laboratory workers, medical students, prison workers, other individuals with occupational exposure).\nHepatitis B 2\nImmunization is suggested for groups at risk of acquiring infection who have not been vaccinated previously (for example HCWs who may be exposed to blood and \nblood products at work).\nPolio 3\nAll HCWs should have completed a full course of primary vaccination against polio.\nDiphtheria 4\nHCWs who may have",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "not-summarised"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/immunization-summary-table-4/blocks/prose-sec-002",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "No current recommendation for vaccination of Health Care Workers",
      "pageStart": 1,
      "pageEnd": 2,
      "target": "../sections/sec-002-no-current-recommendation-for-vaccination-of-hea.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Tetanus 11\nThere is currently no recommendation regarding HCWs.\nHaemophilus influenzae type b 12\nThe main burden of disease lies in infants under 5 years of age. Work in a health care setting is not indicated as a factor for increased risk. There is currently no \nrecommendation regarding HCWs.\nPneumococcal 13\nThe main burden of disease lies in infants under 5 years of age. Immunocompetent adults are not at increased risk for serious pneumococcal disease. HCWs are not \nindicated as a group at increased risk of pneumococcal disease.\nRotavirus 14\nChildren are the target group for rotavirus vaccin",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "not-summarised"
      }
    },
